# SQL Injection Plattform 

## Installation

1. Install Flask and Faker (e.g. pip install flask faker)
2. Install a MySQL/MariaDB database
3. Random Data can be generated using the scripts kundendatenbank_erstellen.py or kundendatenbank_2tabellen.py
4. Change the Database Credentials in sqlinjection.py to valid credentials of your MySQL/MariaDB database

## Usage
1. Install Flask and Faker (e.g. pip install flask faker)
2. Change the Database Credentials to valid credentials of your MySQL/MariaDB database
3. Start the script using python3 sqlinjection.py
4. The application is served on port 5000/TCP.
